@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz/liveness

### 2. Caso Exitoso: Propietario al día (MZ-B-L14) pide un Taxi
# @name createPass
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/passes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lot_id": "MZ-B-L14",
  "pass_type": "TAXI",
  "visitor_info": "Uber Gris - Placa B7J-412"
}

### 3. Caso Bloqueado (403): Vecino Moroso (MZ-F-L08) intenta pedir Delivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/passes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lot_id": "MZ-F-L08",
  "pass_type": "DELIVERY",
  "visitor_info": "PedidosYa - Motorizado"
}

### 4. Garita verifica el código generado en el paso 2 (Toma el código automáticamente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/passes/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{createPass.response.body.code}}"
}

### 5. [ADMIN] Listar todos los lotes del padrón y su estado de mantenimiento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lots

### 6. [ADMIN] Editar un lote individual (Ej: MZ-F-L08 paga su deuda por Yape)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lots/MZ-F-L08/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
}

### 7. [ADMIN] Carga/Sincronización Masiva (Bulk Upsert de cierre de mes)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lots/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lots": [
    {
      "lot_id": "MZ-B-L14",
      "owner_name": "Jesus Plasencia",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    },
    {
      "lot_id": "MZ-F-L08",
      "owner_name": "Vecino Moroso",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": false
    },
    {
      "lot_id": "MZ-P-L20",
      "owner_name": "Familia Torres",
      "is_maintenance_up_to_date": true
    }
  ]
}
